7:  * Usage:
8:  *   npx tsx scripts/cli-game.ts                          # interactive, fallback mode
9:  *   npx tsx scripts/cli-game.ts --headless               # automated, 20 encounters
10:  *   npx tsx scripts/cli-game.ts --model=gemma-4-31b-it  # override model
11:  *   npx tsx scripts/cli-game.ts --headless --json        # AI-agent feedback loop
12:  *   npx tsx scripts/cli-game.ts --mode=encounter         # single encounter
13:  *   npx tsx scripts/cli-game.ts --mode=diagnostic        # print system state
14:  *   npx tsx scripts/cli-game.ts --encounters=5           # custom encounter count
15:  *   npx tsx scripts/cli-game.ts --verbose                # show full narrative flow
16:  *   npx tsx scripts/cli-game.ts --json                   # machine-readable JSON output
17:  *   npx tsx scripts/cli-game.ts --new-game               # start fresh (delete saved progress)
